        {
          "optionId": "opt_mntdf6l1_73df",
          "weight": 100
        }
      ],
      "texts": [
        "I am on a mountain, surrounded by forests.\nFar from roads and fields.\nMy body fled here from far away.",
        "The forest is vast, old, and stretching far from the mountain.\nBeyond it is civilization - villages, fields, roads.\nI am at the edge of it, in the wilderness.",
        "The villagers believe that spirits live in the forest.\nI have not seem them yet,\nBut should go looking.",
        "The villagers believe many things.\nMost of them untrue.\nNone of them are about me.",
        "Out there, beyond the villages, lies the kingdom.\nIt is ruled by the Patriarchy, who control magic.\nI think I might be magic.",
        "My bodies cannot go very far from me.\nBut traders come to nearby villages, from the far away cities.\nCities where the Patriarchy is strong.\nAnd magical knowledge is gathered.",
        "There is so much to explore.\nBodies with experiences I cannot even imagine. So much to see and internalize and build. \nAnd all so far from my mountain. "
      ]
    },
